      },
      "solution": {
        "headline": "Data-Driven Dining Etiquette",
        "description": "Tipperary is a mobile application that provides real-time, crowdsourced, and location-specific average tip percentages for every restaurant. By aggregating transaction data and user input, we provide a 'Tip Benchmark' for every establishment. Users can see exactly what the local average is before they even order, allowing them to dine with confidence and ensure they are contributing fairly to the service economy."
      },
      "product_features": [
        {
